@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix omnlife: <http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn-lifecycle#>.

<http://alex.willner.ws/about#me> a <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#Attribute> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#Component> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#Group> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#Reservation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#Resource> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#Service> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#Topology> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn-lifecycle> <http://creativecommons.org/ns#license> <http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>;
